# Build-context exclusions (design §9.3). With BuildKit this file is used when
# the build names deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore and
# <context>/.dockerignore; verify_image.ps1 passes this path). It keeps the
# 361.6 MB runtime/ tree out of the context so the transfer stays well under 5 MB.
#
# dependency trees that must never enter the image (263 MB + 71 MB, Windows ABI)
runtime/
../.venv/
.venv/
# caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# tests and local evidence are not runtime artifacts
tests/
data/
experiments/
frontend/
.agents/
docs/
scripts/
# research reports and protected inputs
*.md
*.pdf
!README.md
protected-inventory*
# editor / os noise
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
# NOTE: trust/ and fixtures/ and src/monsoon_grid/ui/ are deliberately NOT ignored
# (§9.5): they are runtime inputs. src/ and deploy/ are copied by the Dockerfile.
